{"id":"3ba74441-620d-499b-8c86-f6a5a004fd30","title":"Pastel Bokeh 6","slug":"pastel-bokeh-6","collectionSlug":"pastel-bokeh","collectionName":"Pastel Bokeh","category":"background","categoryZh":"背景动画","description":"A soft, ethereal shader effect featuring a vibrant magenta-pink background (#cf67c1) as the base layer. Overlaid on this are approximately 100 floating white particles (#ffffff) distributed across the canvas, creating a gentle, twinkling bokeh effect. The particles are small dots (1.15px size) with moderate opacity and a 0.5 twinkle intensity, giving them a subtle pulsing quality. A dark purple vignette (#632266) with high intensity (0.89) and moderate falloff (0.68) darkens the edges of the composition, creating depth and drawing focus toward the center. The entire effect is softened by a bokeh blur with a 60-pixel radius and 6-blade aperture shape, creating circular light artifacts and a dreamy, out-of-focus aesthetic. The blur introduces subtle chromatic fringing (0.2) and highlights with significant gain (9.6), enhancing the luminous quality of the particles. The overall mood is serene, mystical, and atmospheric, with a gentle upward particle drift (95-degree angle) creating subtle movement. The composition uses ACES tone mapping for enhanced color grading, resulting in a polished, professional appearance with warm undertones despite the cool magenta palette.","colors":["#cf67c1","#ffffff","#632266"],"labels":["glowing","calm","3d"],"cover":"/shaders/covers/3ba74441-620d-499b-8c86-f6a5a004fd30.jpg","toneMapping":"aces","components":[{"type":"SolidColor","id":"idmsq49irozuba2xlda","_key":"key_msq49irozuba2xlda","props":{"color":"#cf67c1","opacity":1,"maskType":"alpha","blendMode":"normal","transform":{"edges":"transparent","scale":1,"anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"rotation":0}}},{"type":"FloatingParticles","id":"idmsq49u56oudd4wijw","_key":"key_msq49u56oudd4wijw","props":{"angle":95,"count":100,"shape":"dot","speed":0.21,"opacity